 damaged by the storm and cannot return. They intended to find some supplies on the island to repair the boat.But something seems to be wrong, the island is full of bones and rotting flesh.\nLittle did they know that the werewolves on the island had already killed the two adventurers and blended in with the team, playing hide-and-seek with the other humans.", "short_description": "Eight adventurers will explore the mysterious island, but the ship has been damaged by the storm. The werewolves on the island had already killed the two adventurers and blended into the team. You must discover who the wolves are while trying to gather supplies and repair the boat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/8fc94863-a0c7-4a3c-90bc-4a4ef7663c14", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BJstorm studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.notmevr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SOCIAL", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["CO_OP"], "id": "4162848450607817"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422379_694636732055965_3260048634828791404_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=azTFdJn-34IQ7kNvwH8pxYU&_nc_oc=Adn4_axpaaMCPXKKz75Db8SEvls3QpMYZHM1eVM9ddBXMUGt2KsXIe8Y5dCn5SlAdXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss